  "indexNotes": [
    "Mark: remove six imperative-verb matches from the personal-name index; retain the five person-name occurrences.",
    "Restore explicitly named uppercase JESUS, NAZARETH, BABYLON, JEHOVAH and JAH, and the interpreted writing MENE/TEKEL/UPHARSIN. No blanket case-insensitive matcher is used.",
    "NUN and AIN in Psalm 119 are alphabetic headings, not evidence that Joshua’s father or a place appears in those verses. Do not turn those headings into name occurrences.",
    "Reviewed 104 unique dictionary-spelling / KJV-token punctuation pairs. Restore only explicit capitalized token matches under a unique punctuation-folded key; no case-insensitive English common-word matching. On/So/No have explicit KJV proper-name reference whitelists, replacing blanket omission."
  ],
